        "value": "George-Étienne Cartier|John A. Macdonald|John Hamilton Gray (Prince Edward Island politician)|John Hamilton Gray (New Brunswick politician)|Charles Tupper|Images from Library and Archives Canada|Fathers of Confederation|Government House (Prince Edward Island)|George Brown (politician born 1818)|Samuel Leonard Tilley|William Alexander Henry|Jonathan McCully|Thomas D'Arcy McGee|PD Canada|Alexander Tilloch Galt|William Henry Pope|Alexander Campbell (Canadian senator)|Hector-Louis Langevin|Charlottetown Conference|Adams George Archibald|PD US expired|PD-old missing SDC copyright status|PD-US missing SDC copyright status|Edward Barron Chandler|William McDougall (Ontario politician)|Andrew Archibald Macdonald|Robert B. Dickey|Edward Palmer (Canadian politician)|George Coles (politician)|Hewitt Bernard|John Mercer Johnson|William H. Steeves|William Henry Lee|Charlottetown in the 19th century",
